-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Fonts
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

No fonts are distributed with this project. Configs reference fonts by
system path.

Generated type elements contain glyph outlines derived from whatever
font was used to build them. The design license above covers the type
element geometry - the body, the draft taper, the placement - not the
letterforms themselves. Some commercial font licenses restrict embedding
outlines in derived works or physical products. If you sell or publish
prints, that is between you and the font's license.
